    <string name="about_text">AMARadio 100% kyauta ne daga tallace-tallace kuma yana kiyaye sirri.\n\nA da na haɓaka wannan manhaja ne don mahaifiyata domin in ba ta damar sauraron rediyo cikin sauƙi ba tare da tallace-tallace masu ban haushi ba. Shiyasa AMARadio zai kasance kyauta daga tallace-tallace koyaushe – wannan alkawari ne gare ta, da na raba muku duka.\n\nWannan aikin gundarin shafi ne (fork) daga aikace-aikacen RadioDroid. An dauke dukkan lambobin zuwa Kotlin domin tabbatar da manhajar tana gudanar da kyau akan sabbin leagan na Android.\n\nKwasan intanet na samuwa a: https://github.com/ounben/AMARadio\n\nWannan manhaja tana amfani da ebo na gidajen rediyo kyauta a https://www.radio-browser.info .\nKo wanene zai iya ƙara gidajen rediyo. Yana aiki kamar wiki na rediyon intanet.\n\nTuntuba: ben@ounben.com\n\nAbun matsaloli: https://github.com/ounben/AMARadio/issues\n\nIdan kuna son manhajar kuma kuna son taimakawa, ku turo mini ríomhphost.\nAna maraba da ra\'ayoyi don sabbin ayyuka koyaushe!\n\nWannan manhaja kyauta ce a ƙarƙashin GPLv3. https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html</string>
